    "description": "Manmeet and Walass met in India in 2023 , between concerts and open mic they also developed this project without really knowing it: \"Random Waves\". Manmeet came back to France the following year and spent a few days at Studiobato with Walass to make sounds from anything they got their hands on. The beats were intended to be strange, out of usual standards, the lyrics are mostly improvised. \"Random waves\" is an ode to the friendly and family connection that music allows all around the globe.\n\nThe EP is accompanied by a visual on youtube, an illustration combining the universe of both Walass and Manmeet, a resonance in which they evolved, a return to calm while surpassing inner turmoil.\n\nCome wave with them….\n\nLyrics, music and mix: Walass & Manmeet\n\nVocal featuring: Flavien\n\nArtwork: Manmeet and Flavien\n\nMastering: Youyou",
